# Routine: keep ag-dash's deterministic tool-call summaries growing (bin/dot-local/bin/ag-toolsum-review, ag-toolsum/README.md).
[Unit]
Description=Review tool-call summary coverage and extend the rules

[Service]
Type=oneshot
ExecCondition=%h/.local/bin/ag-machine-role host
ExecStart=/usr/bin/zsh -lc 'exec %h/.local/bin/ag-toolsum-review'
TimeoutStartSec=45min
